| Name         | Description                         | Units  |   Default value |
| ------------ | ----------------------------------- | ------ | --------------- |
| `V`         | Supply voltage at the converter's input                         | V  |   350.0 |
| `I_ref`         | Current asked of the converter                         | A  |   500.0 |
